# =============================================================================
# Blockchain Land Registry - Environment Variables
# =============================================================================
# The application works out-of-the-box in Demo/Offline mode even without Supabase!
# If you want to connect a live cloud Supabase database, follow these steps:
#
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Go to Project Settings -> API to copy your Project URL and Anon Public Key
# 3. Go to SQL Editor in Supabase, and execute the SQL scripts found in:
#    supabase/migrations/
# 4. Fill in the values below and rename this file to .env (or create .env.local):
# =============================================================================

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here
